  "description": "Bigmind connects Claude to the sales context and workflows in your Bigmind workspace. Claude can search and summarize meeting transcripts, notes, action items, CRM accounts, contacts, opportunities, pipeline risks, company knowledge, case studies, signals, and team data. It can also create or update permitted content and workflows, including todos, notes, documents, lists, coaching resources, trackers, categories, and sales frameworks.\nThe connector uses Bigmind OAuth and acts as the signed-in user in one selected workspace. Existing Bigmind permissions, visibility rules, and write checks continue to apply. Core tools are available by default, while optional tool groups and write scopes can be configured in Bigmind before authorization.",
